  "abstract": "Best capacity setting so far (k=320, p=32) with a mild orthogonality penalty on V (projection basis) to reduce redundancy. Uses oscillatory 2nd-order SSM factors, input-adaptive temporal gating, global horizon gating, residual copy head, and MAE+curvature loss.",
